eleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55794ed414bcaeec8ceb20a92e3d086b","RawContent":"Original Mori Lee 3124 size 18 slightly altered, like new for sale $600 I&#039;m trying to figure out how to post pics on here!!!\nI&#039;m selling my slightly used original Mori Lee gown size 18 slightly altered, like new for $600","Attachments":[{"Id":33932,"Name":"image.jpeg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-261154-0-79550900-1443649676.jpeg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-261154-0-79550900-1443649676_thumb.jpeg","Width":576,"Height":960}],"Id":1905710,"PostDate":1443635290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Original Mori Lee 3124 size 18 slightly altered, like new for sale $600 I'm trying to figure out how to post pics on here!!!<br \/>I'm selling my slightly used original Mori Lee gown size 18 slightly altered, like new for $600\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deasher@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"190.58.159.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349734426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"brownskingirl","Id":261154,"Name":"brownskingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.178.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"190476999794a741568a0473f1ca7305","RawContent":"[quote name=\"brownskingirl\" post=\"1905710\" timestamp=\"1443649690\"]\nOriginal Mori Lee 3124 size 18 slightly altered, like new for sale $600 I&#039;m trying to figure out how to post pics on here!!!\nI&#039;m selling my slightly used original Mori Lee gown size 18 slightly altered, like new for $600[\/quote]if you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you&#039;re happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos.  good luck\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1905711,"PostDate":1443635502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>brownskingirl, on 30 September 2015 - 05:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Original Mori Lee 3124 size 18 slightly altered, like new for sale $600 I'm trying to figure out how to post pics on here!!!<br>\nI'm selling my slightly used original Mori Lee gown size 18 slightly altered, like new for $600<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nif you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you're happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos.  good luck<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.244.77.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e55151a5dfdf47bd6771a4921d26fe7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1905711\" timestamp=\"1443649902\"]\nif you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you&#039;re happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos. good luck\n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk[\/quote]thank you :)\n\nbetter pics can be sent upon request.","Attachments":[],"Id":1905712,"PostDate":1443636736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 30 September 2015 - 05:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>if you look beside your post button there should be something that says additional options. of you click there a larger screen will open up. you should see something that will allow you to upload photos. once you upload click add to post.nir will give you a photo address. if you want to see how it looks click preview post. once you're happy with how the message looks hut your reply or post message button (whichever it is) and your post should dhow with the dress photos. good luck<br><br>\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p>better pics can be sent upon request.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deasher@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"190.58.159.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349734426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"brownskingirl","Id":261154,"Name":"brownskingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.116.100.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fe1fe74c07fec1f13464f9d67839ef1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am selling this dress and it was never used. I spent over 1,000 US dollars because of the beading. All materials and fabrics are top quality.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I put it on my form but I can show you pics of the dress on me just so you have an idea of how it will look. I need it out of my closet and willing to hear offers. I think $350 is a good price and I am located in New Jersey&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some measurements of me so &amp;nbsp;you can have an idea if this dress works for you. (the dress has a hidden zipper in the left side)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(227,239,237);\"&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99);\"&gt;Label:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117);\"&gt;6&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99);\"&gt;Street:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117);\"&gt;6&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(227,239,237);\"&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99);\"&gt;Bust:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117);\"&gt;34.5&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99);\"&gt;Waist:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117);\"&gt;27&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99);\"&gt;Hips:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117);\"&gt;38&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;I am also selling this dress. same measurements as &amp;nbsp;the post above, dress has been professionally cleaned $300. Ask any questions if you have&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":34054,"Name":"1U0A3451.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-29826400-1444491529.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-29826400-1444491529_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200},{"Id":34055,"Name":"1U0A3443.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-81113700-1444491538.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-81113700-1444491538_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200},{"Id":34056,"Name":"1U0A3495.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-09495400-1444491570.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-09495400-1444491570_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200},{"Id":34057,"Name":"1U0A3461.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-27375900-1444491577.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-27375900-1444491577_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200},{"Id":34058,"Name":"IMG_7424.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-73212700-1444491598.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-73212700-1444491598_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":34059,"Name":"WP_20150422_006.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-13864900-1444491633.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-13864900-1444491633_thumb.jpg","Width":302,"Height":537},{"Id":34060,"Name":"WP_20150422_054.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-49251000-1444491645.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-49251000-1444491645_thumb.jpg","Width":277,"Height":493},{"Id":34061,"Name":"1U0A9780.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-78567000-1444492047.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-78567000-1444492047_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":667},{"Id":34062,"Name":"front.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-26017200-1444492065.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-26017200-1444492065_thumb.jpg","Width":824,"Height":1200},{"Id":34063,"Name":"back.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-52315900-1444492075.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-52315900-1444492075_thumb.jpg","Width":841,"Height":1200},{"Id":34064,"Name":"dress4.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-13080900-1444492097.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-13080900-1444492097_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200},{"Id":34065,"Name":"wedding gown.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-06193700-1444492105.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-06193700-1444492105_thumb.jpg","Width":800,"Height":1200},{"Id":34066,"Name":"belt (1).jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-65537300-1444492115.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-65537300-1444492115_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":34067,"Name":"photo 2.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-66552400-1444492128.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-66552400-1444492128_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":34068,"Name":"photo 4.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-00887800-1444492141.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-00887800-1444492141_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":34069,"Name":"photo 1.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-39996000-1444492152.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-277499-0-39996000-1444492152_thumb.jpg","Width":734,"Height":1200}],"Id":1906134,"PostDate":1444477798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ladies,<\/p>\n<p>I am selling this dress and it was never used. I spent over 1,000 US dollars because of the beading. All materials and fabrics are top quality.<\/p>\n<p>I put it on my form but I can show you pics of the dress on me just so you have an idea of how it will look. I need it out of my closet and willing to hear offers. I think $350 is a good price and I am located in New Jersey\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some measurements of me so \u00a0you can have an idea if this dress works for you. (the dress has a hidden zipper in the left side)<\/p>\n<div  style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(227,239,237)\">\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99)\">Label:\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117)\">6<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99)\">Street:\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117)\">6<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div  style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;background-color:rgb(227,239,237)\">\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99)\">Bust:\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117)\">34.5<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99)\">Waist:\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117)\">27<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(101,99,99)\">Hips:\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(156,128,117)\">38<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>I am also selling this dress. same measurements as \u00a0the post above, dress has been professionally cleaned $300. Ask any questions if you have<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Check my planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150410\/e\/Our+Wedding+\/k\/3e00\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n","Email":"tkandlina@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.134.72.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396867157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277499.jpg?_r=1444491199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linaco80","Id":277499,"Name":"linaco80","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"30824","Title":"Post all \"Knock Off Wedding Dress\" questions\/comments here","LastPostDate":1444477798},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6407,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6400,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":6390,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
